Require hyper

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600

Hide
Type "export GH_TOKEN=${GH_TOKEN:-}"
Enter
Show

Type "hyper"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Tab
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms

Type "?"
Sleep 2s
Type "?"

Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
